# Render Integration

This repo (`crosswalknyc/behavioralgraph`) deploys on Render (team `tea-d5gns1uuk2gs739m7630`).

## Auth

- The Render REST API key is stored in `.env.local` as `RENDER_API_KEY` (gitignored — never commit it).
- Load it before API calls: `export $(grep RENDER_API_KEY .env.local | xargs)`.
- Call the API with: `curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $RENDER_API_KEY" https://api.render.com/v1/...`
- Never paste the raw key into chat, commits, or rule files.

